  "title": "Zucchini Noodles with Chicken and Tomatoes in a Lemon Garlic Sauce",
  "description": "This zucchini noodles with chicken and tomatoes in a lemon garlic sauce recipe tosses spiralized zucchini, chicken, tomatoes, and spinach in the sauce.",
